OL,3,GNEWSAIs Stoke-on-Trent Britain's
OL,4,Afriendliest city?
OL,5,
OL,6,FStoke-on-Trent could be one of the
OL,7,Ffriendliest places in Britain,
OL,8,Faccording to a newspaper columnist.
OL,10,FBen Aitken explored the city for his
OL,11,FSunday Times column, visiting
OL,12,Fattractions like Trentham Gardens,
OL,13,FWorld of Wedgwood and the nearby New
OL,14,FVic as well as sampling oatcakes.
OL,16,FHe described Stokies as "warm and
OL,17,Ffriendly" and said he had been called
OL,18,F"ducky" 17 times in a single afternoon.
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
