OL,3,GNEWSAIs Stoke-on-Trent Britain's
OL,4,Afriendliest city?
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe is not alone in this view. Locals
OL,7,Fsay you won't "meet nicer people
OL,8,Fanywhere in the world" - and think the
OL,9,Fcity's community spirit and
OL,10,Fworking-class roots are the reason why.
